## Goal
Show how the treated and untreated samples separate on a principal component analysis of the
gene-level counts. The deliverable is a PC1-vs-PC2 scatter of the six rnaseq_bulk samples
(A1-A3 untreated, B1-B3 treated) coloured by `condition`, with the variance explained by each
component, plus the per-sample scores behind the plot.

