## Execution
Runs: batch
One job, submitted through `_system/executorlib.py submit` on the configured Slurm executor,
in the `gars-bio` environment. Expected wall time under 5 minutes for six samples (VST and a
500-gene PCA are trivial at this size); memory well under 4 GB. Total output under 2 MB,
written only under `03_custom_analysis/01_sample-pca/`.
